This tree is a Windows UEFI port of three GPL-2.0-only Linux modules:

  Turing  https://github.com/nlzy/turing-unlock
  Ampere  https://github.com/Zagitta/gpu-unlock
  Ada     https://github.com/JustAResearcher/gpu-unlock-ada

Keep the GPL-2.0-only notices on modified files. NVIDIA firmware blobs
are not shipped here and remain under NVIDIA's license; see
firmware/<arch>/NOTICE.md. Generators under firmware/turing, firmware/ampere,
and firmware/ada are copied from those upstreams so this directory can ship
as its own repository. NVIDIA header contracts inspected during the loader
audit are MIT; see those upstreams' licenses/NVIDIA-MIT.txt.
